{"surah":100,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span>دِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>تِ ضَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>حًا","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُورِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>تِ قَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>حًا","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُغِي<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">رَٰ</span>تِ صُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>حًا","فَأَثَرْنَ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> نَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>عًا","فَوَسَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">طْ</span>نَ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> جَمْعًا","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نَ لِرَبِّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> لَكَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">نُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","وَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> عَلَىٰ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ذَٰ</span>لِكَ لَشَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">هِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","وَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> لِحُبِّ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخَيْرِ لَشَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","۞ أَفَلَا يَعْلَمُ إِذَا بُعْثِرَ مَا فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">بُو</span>رِ","وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صُّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دُو</span>رِ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> رَبَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa_shafawi\">هُم بِ</span>هِمْ يَوْمَئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ذٍ لَّ</span>خَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">بِي</span>رُۢ"]}